# Oildeep Gearhulk: "look at target player's hand. You may choose a card from it. If you do, that player discards that card, then draws a card."
# Bot1 casts it on turn 1 off two Mox Sapphires and two Mox Jets, targets Bot2, looks at its hand and chooses the Lightning Bolt: Bot2
# discards it and then draws the top card of its library, so its hand is still seven cards, now a Mountain in place of the Bolt, and its library one
# card shorter. Bot2's graveyard holds the Bolt (it was discarded, not exiled). The Gearhulk is a 4/4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Oildeep Gearhulk
Island x2
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island x5
Mountain
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oildeep Gearhulk.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot2.Hand = Counterspell; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Mountain
Bot2.Library.Count = 12
Bot1.Battlefield.Oildeep Gearhulk.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Oildeep Gearhulk.Toughness = 4
